<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:modeler="http://camunda.org/schema/modeler/1.0" xmlns:camunda="http://camunda.org/schema/1.0/bpmn" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_masterRuleDataUploadFilePopup" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn" exporter="bpmn-tool" exporterVersion="1.2.0" modeler:executionPlatform="Camunda Platform" modeler:executionPlatformVersion="7.15.0">
  <bpmn:process id="masterRuleDataUploadFilePopup" name="일반 업무기준 등록(Excel Upload)" isExecutable="true">
    <bpmn:documentation>masterRuleDataUploadFilePopup — As-Is mui cmb/MasterRuleDataUploadFilePopup (분석 §1 / §8) 의 To-Be BPMN.

★ 부모 masterRuleData 의 자식 modal 팝업 (P-002 엑셀업로드 — MasterRuleData.xfdl:722). 동적 테이블(TB_MCA_&lt;업무기준ID&gt;, DDL on-demand)/동적 컬럼(컬럼정의 기반) 가족.

사용자 결정 (가족 2026-06-04 + 본 화면 2026-06-05):
  - Q-104 동적 SQL 안전화 — 테이블명 서버 재조립(pRuleId 형식검증+pTable 대조) + 저장 컬럼 컬럼정의 화이트리스트(COL_ID 식별자 강제) + 값 바인딩 (As-Is ${pTable}_Mapper.* 동적 namespace 제거 — C-006/C-007)
  - Q-105 audit = McmAuditEntity 체계(C_*/U_*) native 세팅 (As-Is 미세팅 F-006 해소), 프로그램ID='masterRuleDataUploadFilePopup'
  - Q-103 채번 GetMaxRuleSeq 본 화면 일원화 (As-Is 부모 매퍼 namespace 호출 F-004 해소)
  - Q-102 삭제등록 — 빈 업로드 시 전건삭제 차단(서버 이중 방어) + 클라 confirm

3 action 매핑 (As-Is UserTask 2종 + CommonSelectTask 1종 흡수):
  action=search    → searchTask (masterRuleDataUploadFilePopupService.search) — 다운로드용 전건 SELECT * (As-Is Mapper #2 — WHERE/ORDER 없음 보존), 응답 { ds_GetRuleDataUploadList, cnt }
  action=save      → saveTask (masterRuleDataUploadFilePopupService.save) — (조건부 전건 DELETE R-107) + ISNULL(MAX) 채번 + RULE_VER='1'/RULE_SEQ=++max(R-109) + DATE '-'제거·14자 절단(R-110) + audit 8 + 행번호 예외(MT-003, atomic rollback), 응답 { cnt_import }
  action=searchCol → colTask (masterRuleDataUploadFilePopupService.searchCol) — 컬럼정의+PK판정 (searchRuleColDefsWithPk 재사용 — As-Is Mapper #1 동일 SQL), 응답 { ds_GetRuleColUploadList, cnt }</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:extensionElements>
      <camunda:properties>
        <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
      </camunda:properties>
    </bpmn:extensionElements>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="start">
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_to_gw</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="actionGateway">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_to_gw</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_save</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_col</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="searchTask" name="일반 업무기준 조회 (다운로드용 전건)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataUploadFilePopupService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="search" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleDataUploadFilePopup.dto.MasterRuleDataUploadFilePopupSaveRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endSearch">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="saveTask" name="업무기준 Import (Excel 일괄 등록)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataUploadFilePopupService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="save" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleDataUploadFilePopup.dto.MasterRuleDataUploadFilePopupSaveRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_save</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_save_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endSave">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_save_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="colTask" name="일반 업무기준 컬럼조회 (컬럼정의)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataUploadFilePopupService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="searchCol" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleDataUploadFilePopup.dto.MasterRuleDataUploadFilePopupSaveRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_col</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_col_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endCol">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_col_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_to_gw" sourceRef="start" targetRef="actionGateway" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search" name="search" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="searchTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search_end" sourceRef="searchTask" targetRef="endSearch" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_save" name="save" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="saveTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_save_end" sourceRef="saveTask" targetRef="endSave" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_col" name="searchCol" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="colTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_col_end" sourceRef="colTask" targetRef="endCol" />
  </bpmn:process>
